    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="structllvm_1_1_foreach_loop" kindref="compound">ForeachLoop</ref> - <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_record" kindref="compound">Record</ref> the iteration state associated with a for loop. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is used to instantiate items in the loop body.</para>
<para>IterVar is allowed to be null, in which case no iteration variable is defined in the loop at all. (This happens when a <ref refid="structllvm_1_1_foreach_loop" kindref="compound">ForeachLoop</ref> is constructed by desugaring an if statement.) </para>
    </detaileddescription>
